    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 6,
        "text": "Right?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9B404ECC83",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "Audience: Yes!",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2FAD61B7B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Good, I do too.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E876BBECD9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "And we particularly love the underdog ones.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "99F61079A1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 64,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "where many giants are slayed before a resounding success",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6F5F8F6FE3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "You know",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D54B13E074",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "You know, where a small idea makes it big despite all the odds, where many giants are slayed before a resounding success.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "25BE7B5093",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 165,
        "text": "Well, I’m convinced that there’s nowhere where this narrative is more captivating or where it echoes more profoundly than in the countries and communities of Africa.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A3FFE28087",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "through the lens of outdated myths",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CE6A843EEF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "Africa has been portrayed over and over again through the lens of outdated myths.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B596C7DBCB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "The world only sees us as a continent that's plagued by poverty, insecurity and stifled innovation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A43A1C515F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "You know",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "47862F7E9B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "You know, a land of endless potential that forever remains unrealized.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "34F05BA5C4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 161,
        "text": "But yet, underneath these tired stereotypes, a new reality has emerged, one where ambitious Africans are writing their own stories as builders and as innovators.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A042701435",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "We have the youngest population in the world, with over 60 percent under 25.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F62A2745CA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 144,
        "text": "And this youthful energy, combined with increasing access to technology as we see it today, has become the perfect recipe for a tech revolution.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81C3217951",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "We are no longer waiting for the future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BEAB19A862",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "We are actively constructing it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "97D5497BB5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 5,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "our greatest resource",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BE2735862A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "See, our greatest resource is not the gold, the oil, the diamonds, the platinum.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "78143D9B88",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "It has always been the people.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A37C55ECD5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "How do I know this?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "17006346DE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "I spent the last couple of years bringing African tech talent, founders and funders together through events I organize.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "906CDD3BB2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "And also hosting a series on YouTube called Founders Connect.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1E0C3FCDF7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 162,
        "text": "Through Founders Connect I have interviewed over 80 African tech entrepreneurs who shared their stories with me, their lessons, their challenges, their victories.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C60D0787FA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "So I'll tell you some of those stories.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A674EC5015",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "One of that is one of Nigeria's tech matriarchs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "746E50270B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "Her name is Funke Opeke.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9B57118B25",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "We call her Auntie Funke.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D390F087AE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 273,
        "text": "She's the founder of MainOne, and in 2008, she decided to tackle the issue of internet connectivity in Nigeria, and she ended up laying the first privately owned undersea cable in West Africa, stretching 7,000 kilometers, all the way from Portugal in Europe to West Africa.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "339B67EBC4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "This bold move resulted in a surge of internet speeds in the country.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F62F38E7B4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "For context, the earlier cables had 800 gigabytes in capacity, but one laid by MainOne came with ten terabytes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3F001A41AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "That was over 1,000 percent increase in capacity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1186E15CB4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 11,
        "text": "The result?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "888EC9F64A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "An explosion of tech startups",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "84F3256104",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 62,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "the lifeblood of our economy",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CFC151B471",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "trickle",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "106450BC70",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 82,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "massive current",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D2057E4E3E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "An example is another of my favorite stories, PiggyVest.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4B4C3CC521",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 141,
        "text": "It's the first online savings and investment app in Nigeria, and it was founded in 2016 by Somto Ifezue, Odunayo Eweniyi and Joshua Chibueze.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "730E1345CD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "And they are serial entrepreneurs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D6947F5065",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "PiggyVest has helped over 4.5 million Nigerians to save well over 1.4 billion dollars.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F5A08688F4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "That's a lot of money.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F157F43A3D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "Imagine the impact they have made in the lives of people.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BD3620DBD7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 22,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "going and going and going",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E663A94E90",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 95,
        "text": "The founders, Ezra Olubi and Shola Akinlade, were the first Nigerians to get into Y Combinator.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EB175316D4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 77,
        "endOffset": 124,
        "text": "I mean, they made a lot of money for themselves",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A2C9494C63",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 342,
        "text": "And in 2020, when they sold their company to Stripe for 200 million dollars, obviously, but also they returned 1,400 percent ROI to their early backers, many of whom were local investors in the country, thus giving money back to the ecosystem that has allowed them to invest in more companies.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FF9183B824",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "And they sparked a renewed belief in just how big Nigeria's companies could go.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "28DB83711A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "lit a spark",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C491ADC2E3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 91,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "set a raging fire",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F1695B12C9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
