    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 170,
        "text": "They're basically pushing the boundaries of what is innovation in Africa. 15 years ago, the tech in Nigeria was so nascent that people say it was practically nonexistent.",
