    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 212,
        "text": "But I kid you not, if you walk through the streets of Lagos today, you see a ton of young people who are attending TED conferences, who are collaborating in coworking spaces, who are brainstorming ideas in cafes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
